<code>assert \result != -1 => this.get(\result) == null == o;</code>

This assert statement ensures that if the result of `lastIndexOf` is not -1 and the element at the resulting index is null, then the searched object `o` must also be null.
--------------------
<code>assert (\result != -1 && this.get(\result) == null) => o == null;</code>
--------------------
<code>assert (\result != -1 && this.elementAt(\result) == null) => o == null;</code>
